{"about_the_game":"<strong>Command. Conquer. Dominate.</strong><br>In Empire\u2019s Supreme Command, every move counts.<br>This is a deep turn-based strategy and empire-building game where your tactical decisions shape the fate of your nation.<br><br>Plan your path to victory through diplomacy, technology, espionage, and warfare.<br>Whether you prefer forging alliances or leading full-scale invasions, your choices will decide the future of your empire.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/ce2c94957635a37e7fe14ecfac968944.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span> <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Gameplay</strong></p>Take your time to plan each move. Outsmart AI or other players in epic land and naval battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/c92ccea19f635799654154f0b1b034f8.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empire Building &amp; Resource Management</strong></p>Conquer cities, expand your territory, control valuable resources, and grow a powerful economy to fuel your campaigns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/107ec84eb62d42252a71eba388551c2f.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Diplomacy System</strong></p>Negotiate alliances, broker peace, trade resources, or launch surprise attacks. Balance trust and betrayal to your advantage.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/7dedfa40b9c66f09673059655d94d137.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Warfare</strong></p>Deploy generals, admirals, artillery, tanks, aircraft, and naval fleets. Use terrain, technology, and positioning to outmaneuver your enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/ff7f50e38d0f454912ad473085c7ff0c.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technology &amp; Espionage</strong></p>Research military upgrades, extend artillery and battleship range, unlock satellites, and send spies to uncover enemy plans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/32acd88bb0518fd7c4c9d8ef467350fc.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Terrain Control</strong></p>Fortify tiles, place mines, secure borders, and plan strategic strikes to protect your empire and weaken your rivals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/7121531104fcd9d4d48573e9b8be9971.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels</strong></p>Challenge yourself against adaptive AI opponents that respond to your strategies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/f75591040bbea30aefe6c95c4f612cdb.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p>Every game is different. Experiment with new tactics, explore different maps, and try unique victory paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/a84291567e32b9ccbb2a0b3f21f08609.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your first conquered tile to your final decisive victory, Empire\u2019s Supreme Command offers an immersive blend of 4X strategy (Explore, Expand, Exploit, Exterminate), tactical combat, and empire management. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to lead, Supreme Commander?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start building your empire today.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win 5 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/23c78fc68b66b1ad49b39da780f4297cd29b1342.jpg"},{"name":"Win 15 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/958066bafb65e5854437c1f085a2eb0d4c0a2144.jpg"},{"name":"Win 30 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/66a25686250249889f70833f00da294fb7df9e55.jpg"},{"name":"Win 50 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/e4b73ac43233a52934d012f0c967c87a8d0d849b.jpg"},{"name":"Win 100 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/91ec974c9a8b165983cb0ad5c6c49167c07906c9.jpg"},{"name":"Win 200 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/a8afe81cb24a6a7cad714cc90decd498f69d7471.jpg"},{"name":"Win 300 Games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/111092cd4b4c761e624a9bd46717e6e3315d2e12.jpg"},{"name":"Legion Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/102d55f8580f921d5ccb2bf72b5aa4f95fa115a6.jpg"},{"name":"Warlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/0e70712feac7da6e9940d06a20063b0f7acb9275.jpg"},{"name":"Major General","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3991280/23266d8e185b62d57761cdaf184f5f5f26e6ec75.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991280?t=1760280983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/1c76e1f8b6065dce5e1735f90196c072d859be21/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760280983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/88c56a245318b5d4c73cf0fc73d9af14580ee098/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760280983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/88c56a245318b5d4c73cf0fc73d9af14580ee098/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760280983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<strong>Command. Conquer. Dominate.</strong><br>In Empire\u2019s Supreme Command, every move counts.<br>This is a deep turn-based strategy and empire-building game where your tactical decisions shape the fate of your nation.<br><br>Plan your path to victory through diplomacy, technology, espionage, and warfare.<br>Whether you prefer forging alliances or leading full-scale invasions, your choices will decide the future of your empire.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/ce2c94957635a37e7fe14ecfac968944.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span> <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Gameplay</strong></p>Take your time to plan each move. Outsmart AI or other players in epic land and naval battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/c92ccea19f635799654154f0b1b034f8.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empire Building &amp; Resource Management</strong></p>Conquer cities, expand your territory, control valuable resources, and grow a powerful economy to fuel your campaigns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/107ec84eb62d42252a71eba388551c2f.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Diplomacy System</strong></p>Negotiate alliances, broker peace, trade resources, or launch surprise attacks. Balance trust and betrayal to your advantage.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/7dedfa40b9c66f09673059655d94d137.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Warfare</strong></p>Deploy generals, admirals, artillery, tanks, aircraft, and naval fleets. Use terrain, technology, and positioning to outmaneuver your enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/ff7f50e38d0f454912ad473085c7ff0c.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technology &amp; Espionage</strong></p>Research military upgrades, extend artillery and battleship range, unlock satellites, and send spies to uncover enemy plans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/32acd88bb0518fd7c4c9d8ef467350fc.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Terrain Control</strong></p>Fortify tiles, place mines, secure borders, and plan strategic strikes to protect your empire and weaken your rivals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/7121531104fcd9d4d48573e9b8be9971.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels</strong></p>Challenge yourself against adaptive AI opponents that respond to your strategies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/f75591040bbea30aefe6c95c4f612cdb.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p>Every game is different. Experiment with new tactics, explore different maps, and try unique victory paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/a84291567e32b9ccbb2a0b3f21f08609.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your first conquered tile to your final decisive victory, Empire\u2019s Supreme Command offers an immersive blend of 4X strategy (Explore, Expand, Exploit, Exterminate), tactical combat, and empire management. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to lead, Supreme Commander?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start building your empire today.</strong></p>","developers":["iGindisGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/698651a94e7b2a103f86bbf8df7c12d8b6ebec2b/header.jpg?t=1760280983","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 iGindis all rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 11+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 11+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991280/574204294/33ac9fd47e5671583f2a222412a43fa74e945317/1756363373/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757432920","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991280/574204294/33ac9fd47e5671583f2a222412a43fa74e945317/1756363373/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757432920","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991280/574204294/33ac9fd47e5671583f2a222412a43fa74e945317/1756363373/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757432920","id":257190077,"name":"Empire\u2019s Supreme Command Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190077/9d83929d662ec5bd19f3c80c75b79d7a4501bf3e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757432920"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991280/543685655/556d87e5b0c29873a0510e181fb5da1dcf733889/1756363427/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757432924","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991280/543685655/556d87e5b0c29873a0510e181fb5da1dcf733889/1756363427/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757432924","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3991280/543685655/556d87e5b0c29873a0510e181fb5da1dcf733889/1756363427/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757432924","id":257190078,"name":"Empire\u2019s Supreme Command Tutorial - Game Play and Goal","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190078/1b0